Derived files (package ee.extras.wire and ee.extras.mixin.WireRaycastMixin) carry a note in their class
comment saying which Power Grid classes they come from and what was changed. Main changes: Power Grid's
electrical simulation replaced with Electro Energetics wires; Sable, Architectury and Registrate removed;
NeoForge networking; branch nodes stored as Electro Energetics detached nodes; support check added.
The junction box shape follows powergrid:cord_junction.

